  "details": "Title pretty much sums this one up. If I push an update to a world in VRC it does not register that the world has been updated. Eg, I updated my world Sky Sailing a few days ago and the last update according to VRC is in March. I have attempted changing stuff on the website to but it does not change it. I've looked around too and I am not the only one with this issue.\n\nI know there is a Canny talking about this same thing, but, that is from 2020 talking about sdk 2. This is still an issue for me and other creators using the sdk 3 packages and the up today VCC.",
